WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:04.890
Dream 9 Super Collaboration Special!

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.430
Alright, it's about time we get things started!

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.620
Here at the IGO, the International Gourmet Organization,

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.990
we are holding the Tastiest Under The Heavens tournament!

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.960
The victor will be rewarded with that exact heavenly taste.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:59.320
The prize of this race will be the legendary meat, Carat Sizzled Cattle.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.910
Participants from around the world, including pirates and gourmet hunters,

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.440
are now stepping up to the starting line!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.340
Thus, we START!!

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:18.680
Now that's a quick start from everyone.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:33.990
S-Somehow the entire starting area has collapsed into a sinkhole.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.500
Oh no, that is...!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.550
The giant insect with a capture level of 40,

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.410
the Whatta Doodlebug.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.140
What do we... do now?!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:57.150
Has everyone been eliminated right from the start?

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.750
Guess again! A few contenders have broken through!

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.890
Oh, those are...

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:06.690
One of the four Heavenly Kings, Toriko,

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.200
Sunny, and his younger sister Rin.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.870
Along with Toriko's partner, Komatsu.

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:17.640
And the Straw Hat Pirates. {And there's the Mugiwara Pirates.}

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.470
Luffy.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:28.280
Sanij, Chopper, Nami, Franky, Brook, and Zoro.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.040
Rin-swan, it has been so long!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.190
Uh, not him again.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:37.990
Meat! I will eat that legendary meat!

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.530
Luffy, so you came after all?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.890
Nice to meet you again, Toriko.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.400
Wow, there is one more. Who could it be?

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:50.330
This figure, who is in the lead by a long way,

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.740
Could he be...?

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.340
That is...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.890
Son.... Son-Goku!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:06.510
Don't forget about us.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:07.720
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.020
Meat!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:17.630
I will be the one eating that championship meat!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:26.630
Run, the Strongest Team!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:26.630
Toriko, Luffy and Goku!

