00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:42.220
Victory goes to whoever reaches the stadium at the island's center.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.520
It's a Winner-Take-All survival race.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.570
The victor will be awarded the legendary meat...

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.690
The Carat Sizzled Cattle!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.610
The race's live announcement,

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.110
is brought to you by the strongest Under The Heaven Martial Arts Tournament.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.940
That would be me!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:13.330
And our commentary is courtesy of our host, Chief Mansam of IGO.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.150
Did you just call me Handsome?

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.440
No, I did not.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:24.760
And last but not least, there is one other guest with us.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.380
The strongest man in the world.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.290
Mr. Satan.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.570
Please, not in the world,

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.640
but in the universe.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:49.650
Satan. Satan. Satan. Satan.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.190
Hey Piccolo?

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:59.710
Is this Carat Sizzled really that good?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.030
Who knows?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.980
Carat Sizzled Cattle is, you know...

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:04.960
Hhm?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:09.170
a beef so rare and expensive that one hesitates to eat it.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:17.170
That meat can create an endless amount of broth, which people call meat juices.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.020
That is why the price is so high, right?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.750
You catch on fast, Robin-san.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.450
It is easy to guess if you look at the screen, Coco.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.070
It is said that the Carat Sizzled Cattle's bones,

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.690
are made of priceless diamond thousands of carats in size.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.600
I must have it.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:43.740
I see now. So that's why C18 was so keen on entering.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.370
Wow.

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:52.310
It looks like the participants have reached the crossroad.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:56.950
Straight ahead of them are sheer cliffs.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:02.540
East leads to a deep forest, the home of a vicious and devilish beast.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.390
West leads to a vast desert wilderness.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.890
Which route will they take?

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:12.130
This could be the difference in winning or losing the race.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.630
This way is the shortest.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.840
Look at the route that Goku, Toriko and Luffy are taking.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:20.440
They are braving the cliffs.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.440
To climb those cliffs like that...

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.340
They are not too shabby.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:39.820
I'm not sure if I can beat my dad on the same course.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:43.360
Please wait up.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:46.730
Please do not leave me here alone.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.550
Oh, shit. Where are Nami-san and Rin-chan?

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:52.000
I got caught up in the race and lost my lovely angels.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.370
By angel. Do you mean me?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.510
Hell, no.

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.830
That's a big baboon!

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.990
That is a Brimming Baboon.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.730
Please stand back. I will handle this.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.330
Hold it right there.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.360
There is no need to fight.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:28.800
Huh?

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.590
You could call this fella a gourmet hunter of the forest.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:36.240
He will become docile if we can stuff him with good food.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.250
Makes sense. Shall we, Komatsu?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.360
Huh? S-Sure.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.990
You think he likes my cuisine?

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.700
What an appetite.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.370
Now that is an interesting way to fight.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.140
It's too hot.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.950
Oh, so hot.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.220
I will die, even though I am already dead.

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.420
Hey, are you okay?

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.380
Get it together.

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:27.160
It's already too late.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:30.730
I might survive if you let me give a little...

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:34.500
Would you be so kind as to show me your panties?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.270
Like hell.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.640
You're a real pest.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:45.630
Hey, are you really a cyborg?

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.870
Super cool.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.560
Just a flock of perverts.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.360
Hey now, don't flatter us.

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.430
That wasn't a compliment.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.760
Run, run, run.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:10.630
Goten, let's do it with teamwork.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.900
Yeah, Trunks-kun.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.390
Ta-da.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:28.890
Uh, gross.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.990
Awesome.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:35.770
That is so cool. Teach it to me too.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.680
Okay, but you need a partner.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:39.630
Really?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.330
Okay, Sunny.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:43.730
What?!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.050
- Fusion. Fusion. 
 No way, no fusion.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:47.670
Wait. You and I are just too...

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:54.780
That was close.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.670
As expected, Luffy. You're very fast.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:02.550
You too, Toriko.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.320
But we're still eating that Goku's dust.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.040
Is this the summit?

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.770
Then it's straight down to the goal from here.

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.580
Oh, dammit. You've caught up!

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:31.610
Goku. Bad news.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.090
Is that you, King Kai?

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:35.520
Huh?

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.450
I'm a bit busy right now, but what is it?

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.390
A crisis in space.

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:48.600
An energy that is tremendously strong like its evil has emerged.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.730
Huh, really?

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.170
That sounds serious.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.540
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.070
He disappeared?!

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.340
What kinda guy <i>is</i> he?!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.950
I am coming to you live from a clearing inside the forest.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:09.350
Kruppa.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.620
Ah, it seems someone is coming this way.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.590
Where am I? Which way am I supposed to go?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:23.060
Eh, isn't that Zoro? He's still getting lost?!

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:31.800
I had planned to stay quiet through this tournament...

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:38.780
Who... who is the guy that just appeared?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.650
Z-Z-Zebra. {His name like a animal, Hahahaha}

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.050
One of the four Heavenly Kings, Zebra, has appeared.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:46.590
Nobody told me about the tournament.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.730
Where is Kakarot? I'm ready to beat him once and for all.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.650
Who the hell are you two?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.740
Don't spoil the mood.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:08.710
Oh? You punks have a fair bit of power in you.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.680
I-It's getting a bit dangerous.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:34.000
Uh... the broadcast's been cut off.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:37.300
Mr. Satan, what do you think just happened?

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:42.070
A trick. That was a trick.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:53.320
Look at that. Somebody is arriving at the stadium.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.200
It is...

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:00.190
Toriko and Luffy.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.860
Hey, don't count me out!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.940
The earth has been saved.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.900
Oh, and Goku still in the race.

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:14.870
The heat must've been intense over there.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.410
I will eat that meat.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.070
I am winning this.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.930
I'm gonna eat the Carat Sizzled Cattle.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:32.920
Look at that. Goku, Toriko and Luffy have reached the goal at the same time.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:42.670
So, does that make it a tie?

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:44.130
Hmm.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:48.840
In this case, the three of them have to settle things right here.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.330
Huh?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.180
What is this?

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:27.110
Somehow a martial arts arena has appeared in the center.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.010
Hey, it's Mr. Satan!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.380
You're right. Is he gonna fight?!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.470
Yeah, Satan!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.050
Look at that. He just couldn't wait to get in there.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:46.830
Mr. Satan has run into the battle.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.830
W-Wait, I did not. I did not really.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:56.400
That is bad. I might just die. {any better suggestion? I don't like this one}

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.020
-Dad. 
 -Goku.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.090
Toriko-san. 
 - Toriko.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.330
- Luffy. 
 - Good luck.

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:29.470
Satan. Satan. Satan.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:32.730
In this fight, saying "I give up"

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:35.110
or falling out of the ring, will result in a loss.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:37.740
These are the rules of the Strongest Under The Heavens Martial Arts Tournament.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.980
Which one of them will grasp victory?

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:47.250
Without further ado, begin!

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:34.360
Successive hits, huh?

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.870
You two use some unusual moves.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.100
So it was no good?

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:46.310
Here I come.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:47.840
Toriko.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:48.450
Huh?

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.470
What an intense battle.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:09.460
None of them are giving an opening.

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:29.320
You.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:47.810
Wh-What kind of fight is this?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.520
If I'm dreaming, I hope I wake up soon.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:56.810
You guys are tough. I'm getting goosebumps here.

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.510
I might as well get serious.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.550
Serious, eh? Go right ahead.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.720
Sounds good. I'll give it all I have too.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.560
Glad to hear it.

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:15.390
And look. All three are in serious mode.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:29.370
Then I will follow suit. {I'm not too sure about this one: Maybe "Then I'm next" "I'm gonna do it too" or something}

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.800
Is everyone all right?

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:33.460
Well, it looks like the stage was blown apart.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.100
Toriko is out.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.270
Luffy is out too.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:41.410
And Goku.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.620
This makes it a complete draw.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:46.220
No, wait.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:49.380
One still remains.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:54.860
Mr. Satan still stands on the center stage.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:02.630
Th- The winner is Satan.

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:03.670
What.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:14.640
Satan. Satan. Satan.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:22.370
My true power is what caused my victory.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:32.660
Where is the beef?

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.600
Is it even here?!

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.900
What's with this gag?

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.180
There it is.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:52.710
The Carat Sizzled Cattle.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.480
Looks delicious.

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:06.860
Mr. Satan has graciously offered to share the Carat Sizzled Cattle with all of you.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.840
Well, of course.

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:16.370
By the way, you two were super strong. I was surprised.

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:18.130
You too.

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:25.280
Well, in any case...

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:27.670
Thanks to these guys,

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:31.680
he's been lured out nicely.

00:22:52.650 --> 00:22:55.240
{Ab hier shiften}The IGO, International Gourmet Organization,

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:59.440
hosted a race without rules, the Tastiest Under The Heavens Tournament.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:04.250
The competitors racing to taste the legendary Carat Sizzled Cattle,

00:23:04.250 --> 00:23:07.590
were inclusive of pirates, gourmet hunters and other heroes.

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:11.660
Most of them fell prey immediately to the giant Whatta Doodlebug.

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:18.910
But this was nothing to Toriko, Luffy, Goku and friends as they made it through the race.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:22.850
The ones who overcame the various hazards on the way to the goal,

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:26.920
Look at that.

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:31.010
Goku, Toriko and Luffy have reached the goal at the same time.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:36.150
So the three of them will have to settle things right here.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.600
Look at that. He just couldn't wait to get in there.

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.390
Mr. Satan has run into the battle.

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:49.790
The battle raged on between Luffy, Toriko and Goku.

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:01.900
However, in the end...

00:24:04.190 --> 00:24:08.310
The winner is Satan.

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:16.450
My true power is what caused my victory.

00:24:20.670 --> 00:24:21.760
Where is the beef?

00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:23.630
Is it even here?

00:24:24.620 --> 00:24:30.060
At this moment a mysterious creature approaches from the depths of the ocean.

00:24:32.220 --> 00:24:41.100
The Mightiest Collaboration in History

00:24:32.220 --> 00:24:41.100
The Glutton of the Sea

00:24:45.100 --> 00:24:47.650
Goten, look. What a nice view,

00:24:48.530 --> 00:24:50.470
You're right.

00:24:50.470 --> 00:24:54.550
I've never eaten something this yummy along with this great view.

00:24:54.550 --> 00:24:56.960
Me neither. It's way stunning.

00:24:57.400 --> 00:25:01.260
It's still not ready? I'm feeling hungry already.

00:25:01.260 --> 00:25:04.000
I can't wait for that Carat Sizzled Cattle.

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:06.970
It's the legendary most delicious meat in the world, right?

00:25:09.290 --> 00:25:12.420
Now the meals are ready to be served.

00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:14.370
Everyone, sorry for the wait.

00:25:16.190 --> 00:25:17.440
Meat!

00:25:18.930 --> 00:25:20.150
Food.

00:25:21.970 --> 00:25:25.000
A steak of the Carat Sizzled Cattle?!

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:27.120
My mouth won't stop watering.

00:25:27.870 --> 00:25:31.950
Go on and taste the special meat prepared for you.

00:25:31.950 --> 00:25:35.060
We have so much of it, so don't be afraid to take more helpings.

00:25:35.660 --> 00:25:37.150
It looks great.

00:25:37.150 --> 00:25:37.760
Hold on a minute.

00:25:38.450 --> 00:25:40.930
Let's put our hands together before we start eating.

00:25:41.680 --> 00:25:42.470
Like this?

00:25:46.230 --> 00:25:49.140
We give thanks for all the ingredients in this world.

00:25:49.860 --> 00:25:50.980
Itadakimasu.

00:25:51.760 --> 00:25:53.580
Itadakimasu.

00:26:04.970 --> 00:26:05.490
Delicious.

00:26:05.900 --> 00:26:08.080
It's like a fountain of juices.

00:26:08.080 --> 00:26:10.530
The taste just jumps right at you.

00:26:12.010 --> 00:26:15.000
These hunks of Carat Sizzled Cattle are delicious as well.

00:26:15.410 --> 00:26:17.300
I would like some more, please.

00:26:18.320 --> 00:26:21.310
I have never eaten meat this good before.

00:26:21.710 --> 00:26:25.380
Its bones are made of diamond thousands of carats in size.

00:26:25.690 --> 00:26:26.410
So pretty.

00:26:26.850 --> 00:26:32.190
I am just too super to like anything better than cola.

00:26:34.030 --> 00:26:35.950
You are pretty super yourself.

00:26:36.600 --> 00:26:38.780
You do not eat meat?

00:26:38.780 --> 00:26:41.280
Cotton candy's just too good. Want some?

00:26:41.280 --> 00:26:42.390
Thanks.

00:26:42.830 --> 00:26:48.410
Eating meat this tasty, it's enough to make my eyes roll.

00:26:48.410 --> 00:26:52.210
Although, I don't have any eyes to roll.

00:26:53.030 --> 00:26:55.590
Yum. I'm feeling so good.

00:26:55.590 --> 00:26:58.190
This Carat Sizzled Cattle is so lovely.

00:26:58.190 --> 00:27:00.940
It's good enough to make you appreciate your age.

00:27:00.940 --> 00:27:03.940
Hey. Keep your fork yourself.

00:27:03.940 --> 00:27:06.630
By the way, it looks like Zoro-san has yet to show up.

00:27:06.630 --> 00:27:08.850
Forget about him. He's just lost as always.

00:27:10.780 --> 00:27:12.760
It's really good. So good.

00:27:14.740 --> 00:27:17.260
It's delicious all right.

00:27:17.260 --> 00:27:22.050
But you know, this meat is more than just its tastiness.

00:27:23.630 --> 00:27:24.550
Take a look.

00:27:26.790 --> 00:27:28.940
Everyone's eating together.

00:27:31.020 --> 00:27:34.380
It only makes things taste even better.

00:27:39.030 --> 00:27:41.600
Hey. Are you two even listening?!

00:27:41.600 --> 00:27:43.110
Huh? What's up?

00:27:43.110 --> 00:27:44.620
You were saying how good it tastes?

00:27:45.440 --> 00:27:47.510
Thank you so much, Mr. Satan.

00:27:47.510 --> 00:27:49.170
This is a real feast.

00:27:49.170 --> 00:27:53.360
I can't help but reward everyone for doing so well.

00:27:56.150 --> 00:27:57.870
Listen closely.

00:27:58.250 --> 00:28:00.970
Things that are tasty eaten by yourself...

00:28:01.590 --> 00:28:05.000
are even tastier when eaten with your friends.

00:28:05.760 --> 00:28:08.380
He talks a lot like Toriko.

00:28:16.170 --> 00:28:17.220
Mansam?

00:28:18.190 --> 00:28:19.020
What is this all about?

00:28:20.770 --> 00:28:23.550
Tell us what this tournament is really about.

00:28:23.550 --> 00:28:26.450
You have brought together these powerful groups.

00:28:26.450 --> 00:28:30.060
You IGO types had that in mind, did you not?

00:28:30.630 --> 00:28:31.870
It feels like there's an ulterior motive.

00:28:32.270 --> 00:28:35.500
You're pretty good at reading between the lines.

00:28:35.500 --> 00:28:40.140
The IGO used this tournament as a means to capture the Akami.

00:28:40.820 --> 00:28:44.910
What?! The deep sea glutton, Akami?

00:28:49.330 --> 00:28:51.010
What is that?

00:28:51.010 --> 00:28:52.820
Is that an attraction of this island?

00:28:59.190 --> 00:29:00.630
When did it...?

00:29:01.860 --> 00:29:04.250
What is that fish?

00:29:04.250 --> 00:29:06.900
The legendary fish, Akami?

00:29:07.340 --> 00:29:10.520
That thing is the legendary Akami?

00:29:10.520 --> 00:29:11.300
Akami?

00:29:11.740 --> 00:29:15.380
Yes. He feeds from deep under the sea.

00:29:15.380 --> 00:29:18.040
A ferocious and omnivorous fish.

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:22.030
Ferocious? He looks totally puny up here.

00:29:22.030 --> 00:29:26.400
Oh, please. Have no fear. I will take care of him.

00:29:26.400 --> 00:29:29.490
- Okay, come here 
 - There we go, my pretty.

00:29:32.730 --> 00:29:33.160
Watch out.

00:29:35.540 --> 00:29:36.260
Gohan.

00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:43.870
Usopp. Are you okay?

00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:51.360
It has gotten bigger?!

00:29:51.360 --> 00:29:55.850
He grows rapidly after feeding on the life force of others.

00:29:56.190 --> 00:29:57.210
Why, you.

00:30:06.130 --> 00:30:07.390
Gohan.

00:30:08.280 --> 00:30:09.440
Are you okay.

00:30:09.440 --> 00:30:10.210
Yes,

00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:13.900
but I've lost all the power in my body.

00:30:14.840 --> 00:30:17.620
That is the Akami's venom at work.

00:30:17.620 --> 00:30:20.040
Venom?! Is there a way to treat it?

00:30:20.440 --> 00:30:24.550
Only if we catch that Akami within thirty minutes.

00:30:24.550 --> 00:30:28.040
We can cook up an antidote from it before then.

00:30:28.040 --> 00:30:29.940
Alright, that's simple.

00:30:29.940 --> 00:30:32.390
So we just need to beat him up?

00:30:32.390 --> 00:30:33.910
Count me in.

00:30:33.910 --> 00:30:34.730
Toriko?

00:30:35.070 --> 00:30:37.710
We're not stopping until we catch that Akami.

00:30:37.710 --> 00:30:39.940
She said we have thirty minutes.

00:30:39.940 --> 00:30:40.590
Yeahhh.

00:30:41.020 --> 00:30:46.130
So you made use of having guys as strong as this on hand?

00:30:48.900 --> 00:30:50.330
We're coming too.

00:30:50.650 --> 00:30:51.330
Yeah.

00:30:52.310 --> 00:30:57.700
If left alone, fearsome creatures like that would end up devouring everything in the world.

00:30:57.700 --> 00:31:00.940
I'm sure that bunch can handle it.

00:31:00.940 --> 00:31:01.640
Right.

00:31:03.090 --> 00:31:04.380
Well, is it here?

00:31:04.380 --> 00:31:05.280
Nothing on my end.

00:31:05.870 --> 00:31:09.750
To think that a fish would hide in a forest. He's a slippery one.

00:31:10.100 --> 00:31:14.310
Fine. I will continue this on my own. You can head back.

00:31:14.310 --> 00:31:15.690
No way, Neapolitan Hair.

00:31:16.130 --> 00:31:17.780
What was that, you bastard?

00:31:17.780 --> 00:31:20.950
You're too gross-looking to be giving me orders.

00:31:20.950 --> 00:31:24.370
You're calling me gross, whirly-brows?!

00:31:27.320 --> 00:31:28.000
Close one.

00:31:28.990 --> 00:31:31.570
Well, this saves the time looking for it.

00:31:33.790 --> 00:31:35.660
We'll take it out right here.

00:31:35.660 --> 00:31:37.150
I'll try not to kick you.

00:31:37.150 --> 00:31:37.940
What the hell was that?!

00:31:52.310 --> 00:31:53.360
It's you...

00:31:55.550 --> 00:31:57.300
Quit loafing around. Let's go.

00:32:12.860 --> 00:32:13.550
Did it work?

00:32:30.850 --> 00:32:35.130
A beast that can even suppress its energy. What a hassle.

00:32:39.190 --> 00:32:43.310
Waterfalls like these are lovely enough to bulge my eyes.

00:32:43.990 --> 00:32:47.010
Though by the way, I don't have any eyes.

00:32:47.360 --> 00:32:47.850
Too much?

00:32:48.750 --> 00:32:52.690
While the others are in the forest, it's up to us to search around the water.

00:32:53.200 --> 00:32:56.050
Sounds good. I am very much in -

00:32:57.270 --> 00:32:59.990
What happened?

00:32:59.990 --> 00:33:00.950
Stop it.

00:33:00.950 --> 00:33:01.890
Brook.

00:33:08.850 --> 00:33:11.650
It got much uglier.

00:33:11.650 --> 00:33:13.710
It even grew wings.

00:33:20.800 --> 00:33:21.210
What?

00:33:22.480 --> 00:33:23.450
Goten.

00:33:23.450 --> 00:33:23.750
On it.

00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:31.190
Super Gotenks has arrived.

00:33:31.940 --> 00:33:35.840
Now you're gonna get diced up instantly.

00:33:35.840 --> 00:33:37.590
Say your prayers.

00:33:37.590 --> 00:33:38.830
Hold it right there.

00:33:38.830 --> 00:33:39.300
Huh.

00:33:39.750 --> 00:33:41.760
That sucker's my prey.

00:33:43.750 --> 00:33:46.330
Wh-What is that?

00:33:47.150 --> 00:33:51.680
The Iron Pirate: General Franky.

00:33:55.160 --> 00:33:59.280
I already know that you suck energy out through your tentacles.

00:34:00.070 --> 00:34:04.420
But using an attack like that on General Franky...

00:34:04.770 --> 00:34:06.590
won't do squat.

00:34:09.070 --> 00:34:12.460
We are low on time. So I will strike back right away.

00:34:22.170 --> 00:34:23.930
What the heck were you doing?!

00:34:24.820 --> 00:34:32.980
Whatever. It gave me time to get ready.

00:34:40.440 --> 00:34:41.990
The end.

00:34:44.810 --> 00:34:46.870
Oh, no, you don't.

00:34:54.790 --> 00:34:56.970
Where would that guy go?

00:35:00.360 --> 00:35:02.310
I've picked up its scent.

00:35:02.600 --> 00:35:04.440
It's close.

00:35:06.100 --> 00:35:08.450
Oh, come on. You gotta be kidding me.

00:35:17.510 --> 00:35:19.640
I wonder if they're all okay.

00:35:20.380 --> 00:35:23.360
Hmm, for it to have evolved this far...

00:35:27.350 --> 00:35:28.170
That was fast.

00:35:35.560 --> 00:35:35.940
Luffy.

00:35:36.790 --> 00:35:38.200
Thank you.

00:35:38.200 --> 00:35:39.090
Sure thing.

00:35:42.200 --> 00:35:43.420
Goku.

00:35:43.420 --> 00:35:45.720
Looks like I got here just in the nick of time.

00:35:47.670 --> 00:35:51.540
So the Akami was here? It's got a whole new aura to it.

00:35:51.540 --> 00:35:53.070
Really? It does?

00:35:53.070 --> 00:35:56.430
It has reached its last stage of evolution, the Big Tuna.

00:35:56.850 --> 00:35:59.840
It may have a hundred times more power than the Medium Tuna...

00:35:59.840 --> 00:36:02.140
but the flavor is multiplied by that much too.

00:36:02.140 --> 00:36:06.200
We are told to take the good with the bad where seafood's concerned.

00:36:06.850 --> 00:36:08.930
Is it that delicious?

00:36:08.930 --> 00:36:10.310
Sit tight everybody.

00:36:10.310 --> 00:36:12.840
We'll beat this guy up and have a good feast with it.

00:37:13.350 --> 00:37:16.090
Luffy, that move was amazing.

00:37:18.020 --> 00:37:20.090
With this, we're sure to have it captured!

00:37:20.090 --> 00:37:21.080
Yeah.

00:37:38.230 --> 00:37:40.130
Where exactly did it land?

00:37:41.290 --> 00:37:44.050
It has to be in one of these pits.

00:37:44.050 --> 00:37:45.970
They're pretty big.

00:37:46.760 --> 00:37:50.440
No worries. We should start looking. I will -

00:37:51.020 --> 00:37:52.710
Huh? What is it?

00:37:58.630 --> 00:38:00.510
Th-This guy...

00:38:12.730 --> 00:38:13.980
That hurts.

00:38:13.980 --> 00:38:14.690
You big jerk.

00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:26.090
Toriko, are you okay?

00:38:26.090 --> 00:38:28.090
This is nothing.

00:38:28.090 --> 00:38:29.310
But what's with this guy?

00:38:29.790 --> 00:38:33.510
It absorbed all of our attacks and evolved even further.

00:38:33.970 --> 00:38:36.180
It's not just using living energy.

00:38:36.180 --> 00:38:38.480
It seems to have taken in energy from acquired damage too, thus getting even stronger.

00:38:39.310 --> 00:38:42.190
After all it took to push it to this level,

00:38:42.630 --> 00:38:44.190
its growth cannot be stopped.

00:38:45.120 --> 00:38:46.830
What should we do?

00:38:46.830 --> 00:38:52.830
We'll have to beat him by force-feeding him a massive amount of energy all at once.

00:38:54.730 --> 00:38:55.230
Goku.

00:38:57.730 --> 00:39:00.340
I have a favor to ask you guys.

00:39:04.970 --> 00:39:07.290
My Genkidama might be able to pull this off.

00:39:07.290 --> 00:39:08.730
Genkidama?

00:39:08.730 --> 00:39:12.050
It's a way to fire off a little energy from everything including...

00:39:12.570 --> 00:39:15.520
the earth, the forest, the sea and everything that is alive.

00:39:16.220 --> 00:39:17.960
Will a move like that beat him?

00:39:17.960 --> 00:39:22.190
Probably. But I will need time to put it together.

00:39:22.950 --> 00:39:25.260
So I'm asking you two to buy me some time.

00:39:25.590 --> 00:39:27.120
Not a problem.

00:39:27.120 --> 00:39:27.770
Leave it to us.

00:39:29.770 --> 00:39:31.040
Just a little more.

00:39:34.230 --> 00:39:36.170
Goku, have you got it yet?

00:39:36.900 --> 00:39:38.820
Somehow, something isn't right.

00:39:38.820 --> 00:39:40.940
I can't gather energy like this.

00:39:41.440 --> 00:39:43.710
What? Could it be?

00:39:49.110 --> 00:39:51.920
Is it absorbing the Genkidama's energy?!

00:39:52.480 --> 00:39:53.990
Damn it.

00:39:54.700 --> 00:40:00.000
Everybody on the island. Please give me your power.

00:40:01.490 --> 00:40:02.970
That's Dad's voice.

00:40:03.890 --> 00:40:05.870
Everybody, raise your hands.

00:40:06.730 --> 00:40:08.900
Take our energy too.

00:40:09.530 --> 00:40:11.940
There's plenty of power to go around.

00:40:12.570 --> 00:40:14.110
Make a huge Genkidama.

00:40:14.460 --> 00:40:15.650
Go on.

00:40:15.650 --> 00:40:17.410
Gooo.

00:40:18.430 --> 00:40:22.320
It's coming. Coming. Coming. Coming. Coming.

00:40:22.630 --> 00:40:24.550
How 'bout this?!

00:40:27.960 --> 00:40:29.250
What?

00:41:22.900 --> 00:41:26.100
I can't move my body now.

00:41:28.870 --> 00:41:31.720
I'm also all worn out.

00:41:34.980 --> 00:41:38.260
I am ... I am so hungry.

00:41:38.750 --> 00:41:40.190
Me too.

00:41:42.230 --> 00:41:45.860
Okay. Let's all get ourselves some food.

00:41:45.860 --> 00:41:47.700
Yeah. Food.

00:41:47.700 --> 00:41:48.270
A feast.

00:41:51.630 --> 00:41:52.940
Ow, ow, ow.

00:41:55.030 --> 00:41:58.670
We give thanks for all the ingredients in this world.

00:41:58.670 --> 00:42:00.480
Itadakimasu.

00:42:01.040 --> 00:42:03.810
So delicious!

00:42:04.220 --> 00:42:07.010
Yeah. It melts as soon as it hits your mouth.

00:42:07.010 --> 00:42:09.440
As expected of the Big Tuna.

00:42:09.440 --> 00:42:10.620
So good.

00:42:11.340 --> 00:42:13.680
Have some Big Tuna Carpaccio?

00:42:13.680 --> 00:42:17.240
I boiled the Sizzled Cattle's bones down to a nice sauce.

00:42:17.240 --> 00:42:20.260
What did you do to my precious meat?!

00:42:20.260 --> 00:42:23.790
It's thanks to this meat that we're all better.

00:42:23.790 --> 00:42:26.490
It's the top-tier taste.

00:42:26.490 --> 00:42:29.170
I've got a piece of rump.

00:42:30.890 --> 00:42:34.570
This mellow cola is super.

00:42:34.570 --> 00:42:37.510
What a gorgeous pompadour.

00:42:37.510 --> 00:42:39.450
I hate to say it, but it is lovely.

00:42:39.930 --> 00:42:43.150
This meat is just great, Toriko.

00:42:43.150 --> 00:42:47.220
Well of course. The Big Tuna's meat is delicious.

00:42:47.220 --> 00:42:49.460
But you know, things that are tasty...

00:42:49.910 --> 00:42:52.310
are even tastier in good company.

00:42:52.310 --> 00:42:54.800
Ah, another Toriko like person.

00:42:55.400 --> 00:42:58.770
I guess that settles things.

00:42:58.770 --> 00:43:00.700
Can you cook me more meat?

00:43:00.700 --> 00:43:02.130
Yeah, for me too, please.

00:43:02.130 --> 00:43:03.490
Oh, me too.

00:43:03.490 --> 00:43:04.930
Okay.

00:43:04.930 --> 00:43:07.450
That reminds me, where is Zoro?

00:43:07.450 --> 00:43:09.650
I haven't seen Zebra either.

00:43:09.650 --> 00:43:12.340
Bulma, didn't Vegeta come along with you?

00:43:12.340 --> 00:43:14.120
Huh? He didn't even know about it.

00:43:19.230 --> 00:43:23.320
What? They're still fighting?!

00:45:58.580 --> 00:46:01.520
A group of children falling to illness one by one.

